<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>6-Piece vs. 4-Piece Chicken Strip Basket — Which to Order</h2>
  <p>While the standard <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">4-Piece Chicken Strip Basket</a> ($9.99) satisfies most single diners, the 6-Piece basket at $13.49 is the go-to choice for hearty appetites or casual sharing. Because you receive two additional chicken strips for only $3.50 more, your cost per tender drops from roughly $2.50 down to $2.25, making this larger basket a notably better value per ounce of protein.</p>
  <p>See the full DQ food menu including all basket options on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>Dipping Sauce Guide</h2>
  <p>Each basket is served with your choice of one complimentary dipping sauce. Because six large tenderloins require plenty of dipping coverage, we strongly recommend asking the crew for a second dipping cup upon ordering (usually available for a minimal upcharge of around $0.50 to $0.75 depending on location).</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Country Gravy</strong> — Traditional DQ pairing, most popular</li>
    <li><strong>Ranch</strong> — Cool and creamy, second most popular</li>
    <li><strong>Honey Mustard</strong> — Sweet-tangy balance</li>
    <li><strong>BBQ Sauce</strong> — Smoky and sweet</li>
    <li><strong>Sweet &amp; Sour</strong> — Lighter, fruit-forward</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Sauced Basket vs. Plain Basket</h2>
  <p>The 6-Piece is only available as a plain basket (you choose your dipping sauce). Sauced basket options — <a href="/items/honey-bbq-chicken-strip-basket">Honey BBQ</a>, Parmesan Garlic, and FlameThrower — are available for the 4-Piece only at $10.49. If you want the sauced experience in larger quantity, order two 2-Piece Chicken Strips snacks and an extra sauce alongside a 4-Piece sauced basket.</p>
  <h2>Calorie Breakdown</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>6 chicken strips only: approximately 660 cal</li>
    <li>Seasoned fries: approximately 370 cal</li>
    <li>Texas toast: approximately 150 cal</li>
    <li>Dipping sauce (Country Gravy): approximately 80 cal</li>
    <li><strong>Total: approximately 1,380 cal</strong></li>
  </ul>
